Description: Set of 'shiny'-based 'RStudio' add-ins for creating datasets by
    drawing. Users sketch scatter plots, histograms, density curves, boxplots
    and count bar plots in an interactive gadget, and each drawing is returned as a
    data.frame together with a reproducible specification that can regenerate
    the same data. Methods are described in:
    Chang et al. (2024) <https://CRAN.R-project.org/package=shiny>;
    Bostock et al. (2011) <doi:10.1109/TVCG.2011.185>.
